{"4788710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ayuwoki Army", "steam_appid": 4788710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayuwoki Army is a first-person shooter with retro-style mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a soldier who must defend the region from an army of animatronics from Ayuwokiland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 12 missions, you must defend each zone with your machine gun and your powerful electromagnetic pulse spheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines the fun of a shooter with the suspense of a horror game, featuring 12 levels with 360 enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By carefully managing your ammunition and electromagnetic pulse spheres, you can overcome the threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very easy to play, intuitive interface, simple mouse and common keyboard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayuwoki Army is a first-person shooter with retro-style mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a soldier who must defend the region from an army of animatronics from Ayuwokiland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 12 missions, you must defend each zone with your machine gun and your powerful electromagnetic pulse spheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines the fun of a shooter with the suspense of a horror game, featuring 12 levels with 360 enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By carefully managing your ammunition and electromagnetic pulse spheres, you can overcome the threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very easy to play, intuitive interface, simple mouse and common keyboard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Your mission is to eliminate the threat in 12 locations, using strategic bul